### RentACar — örnek OData istekleri
### VS Code "REST Client" eklentisi (humao.rest-client) ile her isteğin üstündeki "Send Request"e tıkla.
### Önce: npm run db:up, npm run watch
### Kullanıcılar (package.json → cds.requires.auth): agent/agent, manager/manager, admin/admin

@server = http://localhost:4004
@auth = Basic agent:agent
@manager = Basic manager:manager
@admin = Basic admin:admin

############################################################
# 1) Servis meta verisi (EDMX): entity'ler, alanlar, anotasyonlar
############################################################

### RentalService $metadata
GET {{server}}/rental/$metadata
Authorization: {{auth}}

### AdminService $metadata
GET {{server}}/admin/$metadata
Authorization: {{admin}}

############################################################
# 2) Sorgu seçenekleri (query options)
############################################################

### Açık kiralamalar: $filter + $select + $expand + $orderby
GET {{server}}/rental/Rentals
  ?$filter=status_code eq 'O'
  &$select=rentalID,pickupDate,returnDate,totalPrice
  &$expand=customer($select=fullName),vehicle($select=plate,brand,model)
  &$orderby=pickupDate
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Tek kiralama + ek hizmetleri (composition) + Türkçe statü adı
GET {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID=b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005,IsActiveEntity=true)
  ?$expand=status($select=name,criticality),extras($expand=extra($select=name))
  &sap-locale=tr
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Sayfalama ve toplam sayı: $top + $skip + $count
GET {{server}}/rental/Rentals?$select=rentalID,totalPrice&$orderby=rentalID&$top=5&$skip=5&$count=true
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Lambda filtresi: GPS ek hizmeti içeren kiralamaların sayısı
GET {{server}}/rental/Rentals/$count?$filter=extras/any(e:e/extra_code eq 'GPS')
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Müsait SUV'lar (araç value help'inin yapacağı sorgu)
GET {{server}}/rental/Vehicles
  ?$filter=status_code eq 'AV' and category_code eq 'SUV'
  &$select=plate,brand,model,dailyRate
  &$expand=fuelType($select=name),transmission($select=name)
  &sap-locale=tr
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Serbest metin araması ($search)
GET {{server}}/rental/Customers?$search=Yılmaz&$select=fullName,email,city
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Kod listesi, İngilizce
GET {{server}}/rental/RentalStatus?sap-locale=en
Authorization: {{auth}}

############################################################
# 3) Draft akışı: oluştur → güncelle → aktive et
############################################################

### a) Yeni taslak oluştur (IsActiveEntity=false döner)
# @name newDraft
POST {{server}}/rental/Rentals
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### b) Taslağın yönetim bilgileri (kim oluşturdu, kim kilitliyor)
GET {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{newDraft.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/DraftAdministrativeData
Authorization: {{auth}}

### c) Taslağı güncelle (her alan değişikliği bir PATCH)
PATCH {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{newDraft.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_ID": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
  "vehicle_ID": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
  "pickupBranch_code": "ANK-CEN",
  "returnBranch_code": "ANK-CEN",
  "pickupDate": "2026-12-01",
  "returnDate": "2026-12-04"
}

### d) Taslağa ek hizmet ekle (composition içine POST)
POST {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{newDraft.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/extras
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "extra_code": "GPS", "quantity": 1 }

### e) Kaydet = draftActivate (taslak ana tabloya taşınır)
POST {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{newDraft.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/RentalService.draftActivate
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### f) Aktif kaydı düzenlemeye aç = draftEdit
POST {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{newDraft.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=true)/RentalService.draftEdit
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "PreserveChanges": true }

### g) Vazgeç = taslağı sil (aktif kayıt değişmeden kalır)
DELETE {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{newDraft.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)
Authorization: {{auth}}

### h) Denemeyi temizle: aktif kaydı sil
DELETE {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{newDraft.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=true)
Authorization: {{auth}}

############################################################
# 4) Salt okunur ve yönetim servisi
############################################################

### RentalService'te araçlar salt okunur → 405 ENTITY_IS_READ_ONLY
PATCH {{server}}/rental/Vehicles(a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001)
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dailyRate": 1 }

### AdminService: araç listesi
GET {{server}}/admin/Vehicles?$select=plate,brand,model,status_code&$filter=status_code eq 'MT'
Authorization: {{admin}}

############################################################
# 5) İş kuralları (Aşama 3) — hatalı durumlar "Kaydet"te döner
############################################################
# Not: Kaydet hatalarını görmek için 3) Draft akışındaki a) ile taslak oluştur, c) adımındaki gövdeyi
# aşağıdaki örneklerden biriyle değiştir ve e) draftActivate'i çalıştır.
#
# K1  iade < teslim      : "pickupDate":"2026-12-10","returnDate":"2026-12-09"
# K1  geçmiş teslim       : "pickupDate":"2026-10-01","returnDate":"2026-10-05"
# K2  çakışma (1007 ile) : "vehicle_ID":"a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008","pickupDate":"2026-11-04","returnDate":"2026-11-06"
# K3  bakımdaki araç      : "vehicle_ID":"a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006"
# K4  20 yaşında müşteri  : "customer_ID":"c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011" (+ ECO araç a1...01)
# K4  ehliyeti 1 yıllık   : "customer_ID":"c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012" (+ SUV araç a1...13)
# K6  aynı ek hizmet iki kez veya "quantity": 4

### Hata mesajlarını İngilizce görmek için
POST {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{newDraft.response.body.ID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/RentalService.draftActivate
Authorization: {{auth}}
Accept-Language: en
Content-Type: application/json

{}

############################################################
# 6) Action'lar (sadece kaydedilmiş kiralamalarda)
############################################################
@open1007 = b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008
@open1008 = b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009
@open1009 = b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010
@appr1004 = b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005
@done1000 = b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### approve: O → A (pickupKm doldurulur)
POST {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{open1007}},IsActiveEntity=true)/RentalService.approve
Authorization: {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### reject: sebep zorunlu
POST {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{open1009}},IsActiveEntity=true)/RentalService.reject
Authorization: {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Müşteri belgelerini teslim etmedi." }

### complete: düşük km → COMPLETE_KM_INVALID
POST {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{appr1004}},IsActiveEntity=true)/RentalService.complete
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "returnKm": 1000 }

### complete: A → C, aracın km'si güncellenir
POST {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{appr1004}},IsActiveEntity=true)/RentalService.complete
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "returnKm": 23000 }

### cancel: tamamlanmış kiralama iptal edilemez → CANCEL_NOT_ALLOWED
POST {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{done1000}},IsActiveEntity=true)/RentalService.cancel
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### applyDiscount: 14 günlük kiralamada %15 uzun süre indirimi var; %20 istenirse %15'e kırpılır (sap-messages)
POST {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{open1008}},IsActiveEntity=true)/RentalService.applyDiscount
Authorization: {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "percent": 20 }

### K7: onaylanmış kiralama düzenlemeye açılamaz → RENTAL_NOT_EDITABLE
POST {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{appr1004}},IsActiveEntity=true)/RentalService.draftEdit
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "PreserveChanges": true }

############################################################
# 7) Yetkilendirme (Aşama 4): aynı istek, farklı kullanıcı
############################################################

### Giriş yok → 401
GET {{server}}/rental/Rentals

### agent → 200
GET {{server}}/rental/Rentals?$top=1
Authorization: {{auth}}

### admin RentalService'e giremez → 403
GET {{server}}/rental/Rentals?$top=1
Authorization: {{admin}}

### agent AdminService'e giremez → 403
GET {{server}}/admin/Vehicles?$top=1
Authorization: {{auth}}

### agent onaylayamaz → 403 "Bu işlem için yetkiniz yok."
POST {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{open1007}},IsActiveEntity=true)/RentalService.approve
Authorization: {{auth}}
Accept-Language: tr
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### agent kaydedilmiş kiralamayı silemez → 403 (iptal için cancel action'ı var)
DELETE {{server}}/rental/Rentals(ID={{done1000}},IsActiveEntity=true)
Authorization: {{auth}}

### agent müşteri ekleyebilir → 201
POST {{server}}/rental/Customers
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Deneme", "lastName": "Kullanıcı", "email": "deneme@example.com", "birthDate": "1990-01-01", "licenseIssueDate": "2010-01-01" }

